      "text": "$\\pi / 5$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "AvI5y",
      "text": "$\\pi / 3$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Rj0Fs",
      "text": "$\\pi / 6$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints : Angle $\\theta=\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{1}{2}+\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{1}{3}=\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}}{1-\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}}\\right)$\n$=\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{5 / 6}{5 / 6}\\right)=\\tan ^{-1}(1)=\\pi / 4$",
